THM-4224 exact audit transcript
================================

STATUS SEPARATION
-----------------
PROVED:
  * the all-order X_m formulas and the positivity of its HYP-9081 gap;
  * the order-ten counterexample and the no-fixed-K consequence.
VERIFIED-EXACT:
  * literal order-ten scan of all 10! linear and 9! cyclic orders;
  * independent subset-DP checks for X_m, m=1..12.
FINITE-EXACT:
  * complete strong-isomorphism-class ratio census, orders 3..9.
OPEN:
  * 25 B_ij <= 27 End_i End_j for arbitrary strong tournaments.
The abstract moment tensor below is not asserted tournament-realizable.

ENVIRONMENT
-----------
Apple clang version 17.0.0 (clang-1700.0.13.5)
nauty 2.9.3 (Homebrew gentourng)

REPRODUCTION
------------
clang++ -std=c++17 -Wall -Wextra -pedantic -O0 \
  04-computation/tournament_plus_min_obstruction_thm4224.cpp \
  -o /tmp/thm4224_o0
/tmp/thm4224_o0

clang++ -std=c++17 -Wall -Wextra -pedantic -O3 \
  04-computation/tournament_plus_min_obstruction_thm4224.cpp \
  -o /tmp/thm4224_o3
/tmp/thm4224_o3

for n in 3 4 5 6 7 8 9; do
  gentourng -q -c "$n" | /tmp/thm4224_o3 --census
done

clang++ -std=c++17 -Wall -Wextra -pedantic -O1 -g \
  -fsanitize=address,undefined \
  04-computation/tournament_plus_min_obstruction_thm4224.cpp \
  -o /tmp/thm4224_san
ASAN_OPTIONS=detect_leaks=0 UBSAN_OPTIONS=halt_on_error=1 /tmp/thm4224_san

